# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To implement the Trotterized Ising simulation, define three layers of two-"
"qubit gate couplings for the device, to be repeated at each of the Trotter "
"steps. These define the three twirled layers you need to learn the noise for"
" to implement mitigation.\n"
msgstr ""
